<title>USA: BancorpSouth to buy back $2.5 mln in stock.</title>
<headline>BancorpSouth to buy back $2.5 mln in stock.</headline>
<dateline>TUPELO, Miss. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancorpSouth Inc said Wednesday its board approved a plan to repurchase of up to $2.5 million of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company has about 21 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
